    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Threats_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy</a></i> </p><p>A FastFlesh Medpac offers a broader range of medical instruments and agents than a standard <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medpac\" title=\"Medpac\">Medpac</a>. Each FastFlesh Medpac has enough materials for a single use. A character who benefits from a FastFlesh Medpac or a standard <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medpac\" title=\"Medpac\">Medpac</a> cannot again derive benefits from any Medpac for 24 hours. </p><p>Using a FastFlesh Medpac grants you a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> check made to perform <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/First_Aid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"First Aid\">First Aid</a>. Otherwise, this Medpac functions as a standard <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medpac\" title=\"Medpac\">Medpac</a>. </p>",
